 "summary": "A compass dial of 60 ticks placed with sin/cos in a loop, a needle that points at an exported target with atan2, and the bearing (degrees) and distance (hypot) printed beside it.",
 "prompt": "Draw a compass dial with tick marks and N/E/S/W, and a needle pointing from the centre at a target point; show the bearing in degrees and the distance to the target.",
